# Raw instrument output (nsys/sqlite/csv/log/sass/scripts) lives in /workspace/output/<round>/,
# never in git. agent_docs/performance/data keeps only the md evidence maps and rejected-step
# patches; the full pre-2026-09-17 dump is archived at /workspace/output/agent_docs_data_archive.
agent_docs/performance/data/**/*
!agent_docs/performance/data/**/*/
!agent_docs/performance/data/**/*.md
!agent_docs/performance/data/**/*.patch
